### Before Foundation:
```typescript
// AuthScreen.tsx (OLD)
<Box sx={{ backgroundColor: '$backgroundDark950' }}>
  <Heading color="$orange500">Gurudevi</Heading>
  <Text>Email Address</Text>
  // ❌ Hardcoded colors
  // ❌ English only
  // ❌ No role concept
```

### After Foundation:
```typescript
// AuthScreen.tsx (NEW)
<Box sx={{ backgroundColor: Theme.colors.voidIndigo }}>
  <Heading color={Theme.colors.sanctuarySaffron}>
    {t('auth.enterSanctuary')}
  </Heading>
  <Text>{t('auth.email')}</Text>
  <Select> {/* Teacher/Student/Principal */}
  // ✅ Theme constants
  // ✅ Trilingual
  // ✅ Role-based
  // ✅ Haptic feedback
```

**Result**: Code is now:
- 🎨 **Themeable** - Change one color → updates everywhere
- 🌍 **Multilingual** - Add translation → appears in all screens
- 🔐 **Role-aware** - Permission checks ready
- 📱 **Adaptive** - Works on low-end devices
- 🪷 **Sanctuary-aligned** - Follows design principles

